---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: How to reach Global Mayhem, a Canadian film and content studio.
permalink: /contact/
---
<div class="wrap feed">
  <h1 class="section-title" data-rise>Contact</h1>
  <p class="contact__intro">Want to work with us, ask about a project, or just say hello? Here is how to reach Global Mayhem.</p>
  <div class="contact">
    {% include "x-link.njk" %}
    <p class="contact__note">The fastest way to reach us. Tag us or send us a message.</p>
    <a class="xlink" href="mailto:{{ site.emails.contact }}">
      {% set markClass = "" %}{% include "mark.njk" %}
      <span class="xlink__text">
        <span class="xlink__label">Email us</span>
        <span class="xlink__handle xlink__handle--email">{{ site.emails.contact }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="xlink__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <p class="contact__note">Best for longer messages and business questions.</p>
  </div>
</div>
